{"translation-revision-date":"2023-09-21 21:49+0000","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"assets\/js\/admin\/settings\/incoming-messages.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"de-DE","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;"},"Off":["Aus"],"On":["An"],"%s ago":[""],"Terms & Conditions":[""],"A Groundhogg license is needed to receive messages. Activate your license on the Licenses tab.":[""],"Turn on incoming messages":[""],"Replies":[""],"Something went wrong. Please try again.":[""],"Loading\u2026":[""],"I agree to the %s, and I understand that email sent to my inbox address is received by Groundhogg\u2019s Messages service and passed on to my site.":[""],"just now":[""],"a month":[""],"%d months":[""],"a day":[""],"%d days":[""],"an hour":[""],"%d hours":[""],"a minute":[""],"%d minutes":[""],"Incoming messages are off.":[""],"Turning them on gives your site a private address to send mail to. Your site has to be reachable over HTTPS, so that the messages can be delivered to it.":[""],"Different site":[""],"This inbox belongs to another site.":[""],"This site has the settings of an inbox that was set up for a different site, and is probably a copy of it, like a staging site. Messages are not received here, and replies are not sent to that inbox, so that they do not end up in the wrong place.":[""],"Set up an inbox for this site":[""],"Forget this inbox? The site it belongs to keeps it.":[""],"Forget the other site's inbox":[""],"Incoming messages are on.":[""],"The address of your site has changed, for example because the permalinks were changed. Messages cannot be delivered to it until Groundhogg is told.":[""],"Update the address":[""],"Inbox address":[""],"BCC this address on emails you send from your own mailbox, or forward your support address to it. In Google Workspace, you can add a routing rule that changes the envelope recipient to it.":[""],"Keep it private. Anyone that has it can add messages to your contacts.":[""],"Replies to emails that you send from Groundhogg are received here, and do not go to your own mailbox.":[""],"Replies to emails that you send from Groundhogg go to the address they were sent from. Something has turned this off.":[""],"Last message":[""],"No message has been received yet.":[""],"If messages should be arriving and this is old, check that the inbox address is set up where you send from, and that your license is active.":[""],"Replace the secret that Groundhogg signs messages with?":[""],"Replace the secret":[""],"Set up again":[""],"Turn off incoming messages? Mail sent to the inbox address will be rejected.":[""],"Turn off incoming messages":[""]}}}